# YMF288 mode, bit 1 of register 0x20: every register reads back through
# the data port, address writes make the chip busy too, and busy times are
# shorter (but ADPCM-A writes keep the long one); CSM is refused (0x27's top
# bit cleared); out of the mode, registers read 0 and only data writes are
# busy. At the medium fidelity.
